<blockquote class="uncited"><div>Hello,<br>I have a DM-1801 which I have been using OpenGD77 on for ages. Today, i tried the satellite option and after setting date and time, the predicting status bar appears for a very very small flash, and then a blank screen remains. Pressing the menu button from here displays "Pass: None"<br>Pressing down shows Empty list and pressing down again shows the satellite freq. screen with 0.00067 R and 0.00000 T.<br><br>To me, it seems as if the keps are not installed, however I have certainly installed them. When I install via the CPS,  "CPS writing keps" appears on the screen.<br><br>I am using the latest stable release, however the same issue occurs on the latest beta.<br>Thanks.</div></blockquote>Sounds like you use the wrong CPS versions.<br><br>For stable you must load the keps data with an older CPS.<br><br>For latest beta you must use the latest CPS  2023.08.18.01<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=2867">SA0BUX</a> — Sun Aug 27, 2023 5:26 am</p><hr />
